  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><ul><li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Brand introduction: Mycoterra -&nbsp;myc - combining form variants or myco- New Latin, from myc- (from base of Greek mykēt-, mýkēs \"mushroom, fungus,\" of uncertain origin) + -o- -O- terra - noun ter·ra New Latin, from Latin, land.</span></li><li class=\"_1588d354 _1588d3518 _1588d3519 _1588d351j _1588d351r _1588d351u _1588d355\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Product description:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Mycoterra's extracts are crafted from our own U.S. grown certified organic mushroom fruit bodies. Each product is prepared using a proprietary formula of freeze dried, ethanol, hot water and cold water extraction techniques maximizing individual species benefits. Each glass dropper bottle contains 2 fluid ounces (59 milliliters). Our collection includes eight potent mushroom species - Chaga, Cordyceps, Lion's Mane, Maitake, Native Reishi, Reishi and Shiitake - each with unique health benefits. We also offer two blends: Trifecta - a blend of the farmer-favorites Chaga, Reishi, and Lion's Mane; and Mega - a blend of all eight of our extract species.</span></li><li class=\"_1588d354 _1588d3518 _1588d3519 _1588d351j _1588d351r _1588d351u _1588d355\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><p>Mushroom Growing Kits – the perfect way to grow fresh and delicious mushrooms right in your own home! Our kits include everything you need to get started, including high-quality substrate that has been carefully formulated to provide the ideal growing conditions for flavorful, abundant mushrooms.</p><p>Our growing kits are easy to use and requires no prior experience, you just need a plate to put it on and plant sprayer for watering. Simply open the box, follow the instructions included in the package, and watch as your mushrooms begin to grow within just a few days. With proper care and attention, you can expect to harvest multiple flushes of delicious mushrooms over several weeks.</p></li><li class=\"_1588d354 _1588d3518 _1588d3519 _1588d351j _1588d351r _1588d351u _1588d355\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">USP (Unique Selling Point): Products made from Certified Organic U.S. Grown Mushroom Fruitbodies</span></li><li class=\"_1588d354 _1588d3518 _1588d3519 _1588d351j _1588d351r _1588d351u _1588d355\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Payment terms: 30 days</span></li></ul><p class=\"_1588d354 _1588d3518 _1588d3519 _1588d351j _1588d351r _1588d351u _1588d355\"><br></p></div>",
